WEBVTT

00:01:35.600 --> 00:01:38.210
The costumes from anime or games...

00:01:38.210 --> 00:01:41.700
Aren't they just some dumb crap
catered towards the desires of men?

00:01:42.620 --> 00:01:45.160
There are a lot of female creators too.

00:01:45.440 --> 00:01:48.680
Then I ask you from a hypothetical perspective of them being catered towards the desires of both men and women:

00:01:49.120 --> 00:01:51.670
What are you doing? Wearing and posing in front of others with that stuff on.

00:01:51.670 --> 00:01:53.120
It's unbelievable.

00:01:53.120 --> 00:01:56.540
Cosplay embodies the expression of what the character is all about.

00:01:56.540 --> 00:02:00.140
That doesn't mean just the appearance.
It requires an expression of the inside too.

00:02:00.510 --> 00:02:04.100
That's sophistry. The insides can't be shown on a photo.

00:02:04.350 --> 00:02:05.570
They can too!

00:02:07.230 --> 00:02:08.500
How embarrassing...

00:02:08.500 --> 00:02:11.060
Don't you think your words are a bit exaggerated?

00:02:11.060 --> 00:02:14.520
Eh? They're not exaggerated at all.

00:02:14.950 --> 00:02:16.480
I don't understand.

00:02:16.690 --> 00:02:18.840
There are people who understand.

00:02:18.840 --> 00:02:19.440
Right?

00:02:19.440 --> 00:02:19.950
Huh?!

00:02:20.570 --> 00:02:24.780
Saki-san, the cosplay of the President you did last year completely expressed her character!

00:02:24.780 --> 00:02:25.310
Eh?

00:02:25.760 --> 00:02:27.690
Please tell her something about it.

00:02:27.690 --> 00:02:29.210
Don't drag that up.

00:02:29.420 --> 00:02:32.360
Er... well... for now...

00:02:32.360 --> 00:02:37.170
For this year's school festival, is it okay for Ohno-san's cosplay photography session to be our main event?

00:02:37.460 --> 00:02:41.280
It's okay, right? There aren't any other choices for our main event.

00:02:41.760 --> 00:02:43.760
It'll be the corruption of the school festival...

00:02:44.250 --> 00:02:46.350
How about you give it a try?

00:02:46.350 --> 00:02:48.430
I refuse to do something so embarrassing!

00:02:48.820 --> 00:02:51.140
You really want to try it, don't you?

00:03:02.010 --> 00:03:06.360
Is there no way for Ohno-san and Ogiue-san to get along with each other?

00:03:06.740 --> 00:03:10.960
How about we make Ogiue-san appear during the cosplay photography session?

00:03:11.190 --> 00:03:13.170
Huh? Why?

00:03:13.530 --> 00:03:17.050
Well, Kasukabe-san, after you did the cosplay last year, you sort of mellowed out, right?

00:03:17.050 --> 00:03:18.410
Eh?

00:03:18.410 --> 00:03:19.840
Is that so?

00:03:22.290 --> 00:03:24.580
President!

00:03:27.320 --> 00:03:30.100
You don't say things like
"Destroy Genshiken" anymore.

00:03:30.100 --> 00:03:30.850
Oh!

00:03:31.280 --> 00:03:34.150
Even though Kohsaka isn't here now,
you still came, right?

00:03:34.530 --> 00:03:35.620
E-Eh...?

00:03:38.310 --> 00:03:39.830
Let's get back on topic...

00:03:39.830 --> 00:03:40.400
Huh?

00:03:40.610 --> 00:03:44.280
Anyway, about the costumes, I can make as many as necessary, but...

00:03:44.280 --> 00:03:46.870
who is going to tell Ogiue-san about that?

00:03:49.650 --> 00:03:52.340
Th-That will, of course, be done
by Kasukabe-san...

00:03:52.590 --> 00:03:53.440
No way.

00:03:55.260 --> 00:03:56.460
Ah...

00:03:56.460 --> 00:03:57.320
I see...

00:03:57.770 --> 00:04:00.940
I'm not against making Ogiue cosplay, but...

00:04:01.330 --> 00:04:02.140
Then...?

00:04:02.140 --> 00:04:05.550
I don't like how you guys are trying to duplicate my "success".

00:04:06.760 --> 00:04:09.510
Ah... What should we do?

00:04:09.510 --> 00:04:12.480
Well, should we talk to Ohno-san first?

00:04:12.700 --> 00:04:14.670
S-Sure.

00:04:16.270 --> 00:04:18.280
Who will do that?

00:04:18.280 --> 00:04:18.990
Tanaka?

00:04:18.990 --> 00:04:19.590
Eh?

00:04:19.590 --> 00:04:22.070
W-Well... I don't mind, but...

00:04:23.330 --> 00:04:27.850
Y-You two are the c-cosplay team...
s-so it's natural.

00:04:29.910 --> 00:04:32.410
Then it's decided...

00:04:35.770 --> 00:04:36.330
Hmm?

00:04:37.550 --> 00:04:38.730
What are these for?

00:04:38.730 --> 00:04:39.450
<i>Ack.</i>

00:04:41.660 --> 00:04:43.340
It's the uniform from Kujian, right?

00:04:43.340 --> 00:04:44.300
<i>Ack!</i>

00:04:44.910 --> 00:04:46.020
But it's small...

00:04:46.800 --> 00:04:47.760
Renko-tan?

00:04:49.540 --> 00:04:50.740
This is Rimu?

00:04:52.570 --> 00:04:53.950
E.E. Sakura.

00:04:54.440 --> 00:04:55.970
Seijuyou Inku-chan?

00:04:59.800 --> 00:05:00.870
Tanaka-san?

00:05:03.080 --> 00:05:07.540
None of these characters suit me...

00:05:08.200 --> 00:05:12.450
Erm... T-This is... I wasn't hiding them from you on purpose...

00:05:12.820 --> 00:05:14.570
They weren't hidden at all, were they?

00:05:14.570 --> 00:05:16.700
They were just left in the closet...

00:05:19.890 --> 00:05:21.630
Tanaka-san...

00:05:44.330 --> 00:05:46.460
Move that a bit to the right.

00:05:47.420 --> 00:05:48.710
Yes, sir!

00:05:50.360 --> 00:05:51.300
Hold on to it!

00:05:53.100 --> 00:05:57.640
What? Ohno got pissed off and you didn't make any progress?

00:05:57.780 --> 00:05:59.550
That's how things are...

00:05:59.550 --> 00:06:01.180
It's a bit embarrassing...

00:06:03.700 --> 00:06:04.980
I don't care.

00:06:11.520 --> 00:06:15.730
Erm... Let's give up on Ogiue-san's cosplay.

00:06:15.730 --> 00:06:18.410
Can you go and calm Ohno down?

00:06:18.850 --> 00:06:21.000
She's in the changing room on the other side.

00:06:22.460 --> 00:06:24.010
This is too pathetic...

00:06:25.570 --> 00:06:27.710
In the end, it's up to me...

00:06:27.710 --> 00:06:31.160
Well... it's "ultimately" rather than "in the end"...

00:06:31.160 --> 00:06:32.470
I'm sorry.

00:06:38.400 --> 00:06:42.410
I don't mind acting as a mediator, but you do know where you screwed up, right?

00:06:42.560 --> 00:06:43.130
Eh?

00:06:45.260 --> 00:06:48.110
I made Ogiue-san's cosplay costumes without consulting her...

00:06:48.110 --> 00:06:48.990
No!

00:06:48.990 --> 00:06:49.630
Eh?

00:06:50.690 --> 00:06:54.830
That's okay. Ohno wants to make her do it after all.

00:06:55.200 --> 00:06:56.050
But...

00:06:56.050 --> 00:06:57.860
I don't understand this...

00:06:58.270 --> 00:07:02.200
You see, the reason why Ohno is pissed off now is not because of Ogiue.

00:07:02.200 --> 00:07:02.960
Instead...

00:07:02.960 --> 00:07:05.330
Good morning.

00:07:05.330 --> 00:07:06.290
Yo! Good morning!

00:07:06.290 --> 00:07:07.450
H-Hi.

00:07:10.530 --> 00:07:11.460
Good morning!

00:07:11.460 --> 00:07:12.060
Good morning.

00:07:12.060 --> 00:07:13.320
Guten morgen!

00:07:14.030 --> 00:07:15.070
What's going on?

00:07:15.070 --> 00:07:16.060
I-It's nothing.

00:07:16.060 --> 00:07:17.760
Y-Yeah, it's nothing.

00:07:17.760 --> 00:07:19.520
A-Ah! It's nothing.

00:07:20.240 --> 00:07:21.830
Well, I'll go and give it a try.

00:07:31.770 --> 00:07:35.570
I don't care if he makes costumes for Ogiue-san.

00:07:35.570 --> 00:07:36.330
Hmm...

00:07:37.110 --> 00:07:39.400
Saki-san, he made a lot for you too.

00:07:39.400 --> 00:07:41.980
Eh? I don't want them...

00:07:41.980 --> 00:07:43.500
They're over there.

00:07:43.880 --> 00:07:44.340
Ah?

00:07:45.290 --> 00:07:46.880
What was he thinking...?

00:07:47.270 --> 00:07:52.720
I guess my natural instinct is to want to see someone
cosplay if she gives me a "This is..." feeling.

00:07:52.720 --> 00:07:54.280
Instinct, eh...?

00:07:54.660 --> 00:07:58.050
But the fact that he didn't tell me about making them...

00:07:58.050 --> 00:08:04.260
I'm not siding with him, but... from the way he sees it,
you would have said no even if he had told you about it.

00:08:04.260 --> 00:08:05.630
I wouldn't have said that.

00:08:05.630 --> 00:08:06.600
Really?

00:08:07.210 --> 00:08:10.570
You know what'll happen if I keep having arguments with him...

00:08:11.600 --> 00:08:14.040
Ah, that's true. Give and take.

00:08:14.390 --> 00:08:18.740
But look, the costumes for Ogiue-san...

00:08:19.230 --> 00:08:21.240
This... and this...

00:08:23.360 --> 00:08:26.700
And... this... and this...

00:08:26.700 --> 00:08:28.190
This as well...

00:08:28.930 --> 00:08:30.670
Those over there too.

00:08:30.670 --> 00:08:31.370
Eh?

00:08:33.440 --> 00:08:36.660
Well... I can see why you're angry...

00:08:36.810 --> 00:08:39.880
Right?! This many and this passionately!

00:08:40.330 --> 00:08:43.640
He made so many costumes of these loli characters that I'm not suited for!

00:08:43.870 --> 00:08:47.490
And to actually bring them here in spite of the situation...

00:08:47.490 --> 00:08:49.860
No. I brought them here.

00:08:49.860 --> 00:08:52.110
E-Eh...? I see...

00:08:52.520 --> 00:08:56.830
But oh well... Tanaka is the type who lives for cosplaying, right?

00:08:57.390 --> 00:08:59.080
Try to forgive him for it.

00:08:59.580 --> 00:09:00.920
I understand.

00:09:01.810 --> 00:09:04.520
Eh? You understand?

00:09:04.750 --> 00:09:08.230
I understand, but... even though I say that...

00:09:08.670 --> 00:09:12.840
It's somehow different... as a team...

00:09:13.270 --> 00:09:15.490
"As a team"? I see...

00:09:15.880 --> 00:09:18.210
That's right. First...

00:09:18.590 --> 00:09:20.700
Saki-san, you're thinking too much about it.

00:09:22.650 --> 00:09:23.820
I guess so.

00:09:28.010 --> 00:09:29.850
Ah, she came out.

00:09:31.400 --> 00:09:32.610
How is she?

00:09:32.610 --> 00:09:34.560
Well, she's okay, I guess.

00:09:34.560 --> 00:09:36.050
Ah...

00:09:36.330 --> 00:09:39.500
However, it's better if you apologize to her now.

00:09:40.170 --> 00:09:41.010
Okay.

00:09:41.010 --> 00:09:42.240
Apologize properly.

00:09:42.240 --> 00:09:43.870
Don't leave anything unresolved.

00:09:43.870 --> 00:09:45.060
I'll do as you say.

00:09:50.810 --> 00:09:53.030
Ah, I'm sorry. It's not time yet.

00:09:53.030 --> 00:09:54.230
Oh, okay.

00:09:56.870 --> 00:09:57.410
Huh?

00:09:57.890 --> 00:10:01.970
For some reason, I feel like making Ogiue cosplay.

00:10:01.970 --> 00:10:02.710
Eh?

00:10:03.180 --> 00:10:04.560
After seeing that large number of costumes.

00:10:04.940 --> 00:10:06.240
B-Because of that?

00:10:06.990 --> 00:10:12.430
Also, <i>that</i> might indeed lead to some kind of change. Experience tells me so.

00:10:12.430 --> 00:10:13.660
As I thought!

00:10:16.960 --> 00:10:19.390
But... doing that now...

00:10:19.910 --> 00:10:21.850
seems impossible.

00:10:22.890 --> 00:10:24.300
Hmm, it might be a bit difficult,

00:10:24.640 --> 00:10:29.810
but she bought those clothes because of
the salesperson's recommendation, right?

00:10:35.440 --> 00:10:38.050
Ah, she did.

00:10:38.420 --> 00:10:41.100
I'm a professional when it comes to
working part-time as a salesperson.

00:10:41.100 --> 00:10:43.970
Ah, I don't understand how you can be so "professional" when it comes to working part-time...

00:10:43.970 --> 00:10:45.810
I sort of get what she's trying to say.

00:10:45.810 --> 00:10:46.840
Well, just watch.

00:10:47.310 --> 00:10:49.060
Hey, Ogi! Come here for a sec!

00:10:49.420 --> 00:10:50.020
Eh?

00:10:50.780 --> 00:10:51.990
Come, come!

00:10:51.990 --> 00:10:53.460
W-What is it?

00:10:53.460 --> 00:10:54.680
Well, just come with me.

00:10:56.600 --> 00:10:59.540
Tanaka, Ohno! Can I come in?

00:10:59.970 --> 00:11:02.430
O-Okay. Sure.

00:11:03.410 --> 00:11:04.990
Hope I'm not interrupting anything.

00:11:06.050 --> 00:11:07.640
What are you saying?

00:11:07.890 --> 00:11:10.330
Tanaka, would you mind going out for a while?

00:11:10.760 --> 00:11:12.130
What is this all about?

00:11:12.620 --> 00:11:13.500
Eh?

00:11:13.500 --> 00:11:15.090
Eh? What?

00:11:15.350 --> 00:11:17.070
Well... for a while.

00:11:17.230 --> 00:11:19.330
Come on, come on! Hurry up and go!

00:11:19.330 --> 00:11:21.230
Eh? Why...?

00:11:23.800 --> 00:11:25.020
Don't tell me!

00:11:25.020 --> 00:11:26.390
Yes, it's "Don't tell me".

00:11:26.390 --> 00:11:28.350
It's full of poison!

00:11:28.350 --> 00:11:28.750
Eh?

00:11:34.330 --> 00:11:36.680
Come on, come on. Ogi, Ogi.

00:11:36.680 --> 00:11:38.000
What are you trying to do?

00:11:38.000 --> 00:11:39.740
I won't wear it. It's disgusting.

00:11:39.740 --> 00:11:42.010
It's okay not to wear it. It's okay not to wear it.

00:11:42.010 --> 00:11:43.720
I just want to see how it looks on you.

00:11:44.020 --> 00:11:46.590
A lot of effort was put into making it.
We just want to see how it looks.

00:11:46.590 --> 00:11:48.190
We were wondering how it would look.

00:11:48.190 --> 00:11:50.240
Senpai, you're not the one who made it, right?

00:11:50.240 --> 00:11:52.830
Come on, come on! Look in the mirror.

00:11:53.710 --> 00:11:56.080
Oh, isn't that nice?

00:11:56.080 --> 00:11:59.860
Ogiue, you have big eyes, so these cute clothes suit you.

00:12:00.830 --> 00:12:02.830
How cute!

00:12:03.950 --> 00:12:05.800
Look! How about this...

00:12:06.300 --> 00:12:07.010
or this?

00:12:07.010 --> 00:12:09.330
Oh! Nice, nice, nice!

00:12:09.330 --> 00:12:11.740
There's this one too. Oh nice, nice!

00:12:12.480 --> 00:12:13.950
Why don't you let your hair down for a while?

00:12:13.950 --> 00:12:15.360
Eh? Why?

00:12:15.360 --> 00:12:18.310
Don't worry, you're not going to wear it. Just let your hair down.

00:12:19.320 --> 00:12:20.570
Erm... But I don't want to...

00:12:21.710 --> 00:12:23.760
They look weird when we tried to see how the clothes look on you, right?

00:12:24.160 --> 00:12:26.420
Just for now. It's only for a while.

00:12:26.850 --> 00:12:27.790
Eh...

00:12:29.730 --> 00:12:30.240
Huh?!

00:12:30.720 --> 00:12:33.240
Hey Saki-san, what are you doing?

00:12:33.240 --> 00:12:38.110
Ah, I was thinking about making Ogiue cosplay.

00:12:38.110 --> 00:12:40.440
Eh? Why?

00:12:40.940 --> 00:12:44.400
It's okay, right? You're not going to try to stop me, right?

00:12:44.830 --> 00:12:47.380
Forcing someone to cosplay is against my beliefs.

00:12:48.310 --> 00:12:52.480
Oh? I was forced to do it last year though...

00:12:53.620 --> 00:12:55.280
That's nice, that's nice.

00:12:55.280 --> 00:12:56.010
How about this?

00:13:04.860 --> 00:13:05.680
You know...

00:13:06.810 --> 00:13:08.290
it really suits her.

00:13:08.290 --> 00:13:11.260
Well... I agree, but...

00:13:13.810 --> 00:13:15.230
<i>They're looking at me.
They're looking at me...</i>

00:13:17.650 --> 00:13:19.760
So, that's what it looks like.

00:13:19.760 --> 00:13:20.710
Huh?

00:13:20.940 --> 00:13:23.200
Thanks. Good work.

00:13:24.320 --> 00:13:24.870
Hmm?

00:13:24.870 --> 00:13:26.690
A-Ah?! It's nothing...

00:13:28.790 --> 00:13:32.180
Hmm? What is it? You want to take a better look?

00:13:32.180 --> 00:13:32.920
No.

00:13:33.410 --> 00:13:34.800
Then why don't you put it on?

00:13:34.800 --> 00:13:35.660
No thanks.

00:13:37.160 --> 00:13:41.370
<i>Ah, this is what Saki-san is best at: convincing people.</i>

00:13:41.610 --> 00:13:45.340
Eh? But... It's such a rare opportunity!

00:13:45.340 --> 00:13:48.650
It's okay. I'm not interested in cosplaying.

00:13:49.130 --> 00:13:52.310
<i>Ah... I nearly got fooled too.</i>

00:13:52.310 --> 00:13:54.170
Eh? Is that so...?

00:13:54.610 --> 00:13:57.270
How about this: will you
wear it if I wear one too?

00:13:57.770 --> 00:13:58.580
Eh?!

00:13:59.220 --> 00:14:01.750
Y-You're wearing one...?

00:14:02.040 --> 00:14:04.220
I'll wear one if Ogiue wears one.

00:14:04.220 --> 00:14:06.330
E-Eh.... Eh...

00:14:10.810 --> 00:14:13.740
<i>Wow, she suddenly acts completely opposite of what she really is.</i>

00:14:14.510 --> 00:14:17.160
<i>Ogiue-san didn't notice it though.</i>

00:14:17.570 --> 00:14:19.540
So, what do you all think?

00:14:19.540 --> 00:14:21.630
What do you mean?

00:14:21.980 --> 00:14:24.050
Hmm... will she wear one?

00:14:24.050 --> 00:14:25.130
Ogiue-san?

00:14:25.350 --> 00:14:26.850
Fifty-fifty chance of either.

00:14:26.850 --> 00:14:29.180
Well, sixty-forty isn't impossible.

00:14:29.410 --> 00:14:31.140
I-It's impossible.

00:14:31.470 --> 00:14:32.350
She'll wear it.

00:14:32.590 --> 00:14:35.050
Eh? You sound so confident.

00:14:35.190 --> 00:14:37.680
Yes, because Saki-chan is doing it.

00:14:38.140 --> 00:14:41.220
Even though it's Kasukabe-san... well...

00:14:41.220 --> 00:14:45.370
Kuchi will win! I'm betting my Kujian cellphone strap!

00:14:46.940 --> 00:14:48.470
We all have one.

00:14:48.730 --> 00:14:51.450
I'll say yes, since I want to see her wear it.

00:14:51.450 --> 00:14:52.230
Eh?

00:14:52.900 --> 00:14:55.230
Hey, hey, you're someone directly involved in this troublesome mess, right?!

00:14:55.230 --> 00:14:56.850
That's why...

00:14:56.850 --> 00:14:58.890
I think that she won't though.

00:15:03.950 --> 00:15:04.820
Won't wear.

00:15:05.910 --> 00:15:06.680
Will wear.

00:15:08.890 --> 00:15:11.660
It's okay after all. It's so troublesome.

00:15:11.660 --> 00:15:14.350
<i>Now it's just "troublesome"?</i>

00:15:14.560 --> 00:15:16.890
It's okay. You're only wearing it in here.

00:15:16.890 --> 00:15:19.350
The guys definitely won't get to see it.

00:15:19.760 --> 00:15:21.750
Obviously! Who would want...

00:15:21.750 --> 00:15:23.660
Then just wear it for a bit!

00:15:24.400 --> 00:15:25.320
It's okay...

00:15:25.490 --> 00:15:28.580
It's just for a while! Just a little bit!
It's just a little bit!

00:15:28.580 --> 00:15:30.160
It's okay. It's okay.

00:15:30.510 --> 00:15:32.780
<i>Saki-san, it's just one more step!</i>

00:15:33.200 --> 00:15:35.440
Photos and stuff won't be taken!

00:15:36.200 --> 00:15:37.500
Photos are...

00:15:37.500 --> 00:15:39.490
Come on, it's just giving it a try.

00:15:39.490 --> 00:15:41.610
Take off your clothes and give it a try.

00:15:41.610 --> 00:15:46.250
No... I ron't knofh horw mush clothaes Irr neert to trake auf...

00:15:49.190 --> 00:15:51.770
Then I'll take them off for you!

00:15:51.770 --> 00:15:52.930
Irs't frine! Irr trake irs auf mysylf! Irr trake irs auf!
Then I'll take them off for you!

00:15:52.930 --> 00:15:55.950
Irs't frine! Irr trake irs auf mysylf! Irr trake irs auf!

00:15:55.950 --> 00:15:56.700
Is it going well...?

00:15:56.700 --> 00:15:57.650
Irr trake irs auf mysylf!
Is it going well...?

00:15:57.650 --> 00:15:59.140
Irr trake irs auf mysylf!

00:16:04.980 --> 00:16:05.820
<i>She fell for it!</i>

00:16:07.110 --> 00:16:12.080
<i>Saki-san... you could be an AV scout if you were a guy...</i>

00:16:25.120 --> 00:16:26.400
Eh...?

00:16:31.860 --> 00:16:34.960
Oh! You're cosplaying!

00:16:35.450 --> 00:16:36.160
Yes...

00:16:39.130 --> 00:16:42.100
<i>S-She seems cute...</i>

00:16:43.050 --> 00:16:44.540
Ohno, what do you think?

00:16:44.540 --> 00:16:46.580
I-It's Renko-chan from Kujian, right?

00:16:46.580 --> 00:16:48.230
That's not what I meant.

00:16:49.520 --> 00:16:52.900
Yes... well... isn't that cute?

00:16:53.120 --> 00:16:54.130
Yes?

00:16:54.810 --> 00:16:57.030
Yes, yes. She's cute.

00:16:57.030 --> 00:16:59.530
Please don't keep asking me questions.

00:16:59.530 --> 00:17:00.560
She said that you're cute.

00:17:01.250 --> 00:17:03.100
Nope, you're cute in your normal get-up too.

00:17:07.900 --> 00:17:10.070
My legs feel cold for some reason.

00:17:10.070 --> 00:17:12.060
The material is kind of cheesy too...

00:17:12.850 --> 00:17:13.510
Huh?

00:17:15.240 --> 00:17:19.190
I don't know anything about
the character either.

00:17:19.190 --> 00:17:21.580
There are people who start cosplaying by working on the appearance first.

00:17:21.580 --> 00:17:22.990
<i>There are?</i>

00:17:23.320 --> 00:17:27.030
It's okay if you give it a little try and find fun in doing so.

00:17:31.290 --> 00:17:34.930
Ah, sorry. Please wait a little more.

00:17:35.890 --> 00:17:36.900
Ohno-san!

00:17:37.560 --> 00:17:39.260
It's nearly time!

00:17:39.260 --> 00:17:41.540
Eh? I-It's already that late?

00:17:41.540 --> 00:17:42.830
Have you finished dressing up?

00:17:42.830 --> 00:17:43.850
Not yet.

00:17:44.490 --> 00:17:46.720
Do you need me to help you get dressed? I'm coming in.

00:17:46.720 --> 00:17:47.410
Y-You can't!

00:17:47.410 --> 00:17:47.990
Eh?

00:17:48.420 --> 00:17:51.310
Saki-san, Ogiue-san, can you help me?

00:17:51.310 --> 00:17:53.150
Eh? But I am...

00:17:53.150 --> 00:17:54.300
You can take it off later.

00:17:54.680 --> 00:17:55.680
E-Eh...?

00:17:56.270 --> 00:17:58.060
Ogi, you should just go out like this.

00:17:58.060 --> 00:17:58.880
No way!

00:17:59.220 --> 00:18:01.100
Can you hand me the MOS-KOS headgear over there?

00:18:01.100 --> 00:18:01.710
Eh?

00:18:02.290 --> 00:18:04.310
Erm... Erm...

00:18:21.950 --> 00:18:23.440
It's a hit.

00:18:23.440 --> 00:18:25.910
As expected of our main attraction.

00:18:25.910 --> 00:18:28.870
It seems that there are a lot of people who
came to the school festival especially for this.

00:18:28.870 --> 00:18:30.860
I-It's being posted on the Internet too.

00:18:31.370 --> 00:18:31.830
Oh?

00:18:32.910 --> 00:18:34.330
They finally came out.

00:18:38.330 --> 00:18:39.680
Yo.

00:18:44.980 --> 00:18:46.370
It's amazing.

00:18:46.370 --> 00:18:48.900
Thanks to you, I guess. I guess.

00:18:49.740 --> 00:18:51.520
So, how did it go?

00:18:51.520 --> 00:18:54.250
Huh? How do you think it ended up?

00:18:54.250 --> 00:18:55.850
She tried it. Cosplaying.

00:18:55.850 --> 00:18:56.360
Eh?

00:18:57.360 --> 00:18:59.220
Seriously? She tried it?

00:18:59.520 --> 00:19:00.230
Impossible!

00:19:00.720 --> 00:19:01.700
Which character?

00:19:02.090 --> 00:19:05.390
That one from Kujian... What's her name...

00:19:05.890 --> 00:19:07.910
It's Kamishakujii Renko!

00:19:07.910 --> 00:19:09.370
Ah...!

00:19:09.620 --> 00:19:13.060
Kamishakujii...? I see...

00:19:15.230 --> 00:19:17.550
It pisses me off that you guys sound so happy!

00:19:19.280 --> 00:19:23.510
Ack! There goes my first edition copy of Wild Soul...

00:19:24.320 --> 00:19:26.500
Woot! I was right!

00:19:27.480 --> 00:19:29.320
You guys were betting on it?!

00:19:29.980 --> 00:19:31.590
Erm... Well...

00:19:31.590 --> 00:19:34.030
It's just for fun! It's just for fun!

00:19:34.030 --> 00:19:37.210
Coming from your mouth, it doesn't sound fun at all!

00:19:37.210 --> 00:19:38.690
Kasukabe-san!

00:19:39.000 --> 00:19:40.430
I was anticipating it.

00:19:40.760 --> 00:19:41.190
Eh?

00:19:42.750 --> 00:19:43.630
Huh?

00:19:43.920 --> 00:19:45.830
Everyone wanted to see.

00:19:46.910 --> 00:19:49.830
Saki-chan looked so cool last time.

00:19:55.560 --> 00:19:58.480
So Kohsaka, which side did you bet on?

00:19:58.780 --> 00:20:01.310
That Ogiue-san would cosplay, of course.

00:20:01.310 --> 00:20:02.450
Tanaka-san bet that too.

00:20:02.780 --> 00:20:03.870
Who bet that she wouldn't?

00:20:04.430 --> 00:20:05.030
Below.

00:20:10.240 --> 00:20:12.220
You guys are retarded.

00:20:12.220 --> 00:20:14.850
No one but Kohsaka understands it.

00:20:17.320 --> 00:20:20.210
So, what do you get for winning?

00:20:20.210 --> 00:20:21.530
Wild Soul!

00:20:21.820 --> 00:20:23.500
Harahoro's Prize.

00:20:23.880 --> 00:20:24.380
Eh?

00:20:26.490 --> 00:20:28.570
Plus the bill for the drinks.

00:20:28.570 --> 00:20:30.740
K-Kasukabe-san, why are you...

00:20:30.740 --> 00:20:32.810
Kohsaka's victory is my victory.

00:20:32.810 --> 00:20:34.540
Nice Gian line!

00:20:34.540 --> 00:20:34.990
Huh?

00:20:47.390 --> 00:20:49.590
T-The Vice President?

00:20:49.590 --> 00:20:53.810
Ogiue-san's Renko-tan would be as good as that.

00:20:54.200 --> 00:20:56.860
It would be great if they appeared at the photography session together.

00:20:56.860 --> 00:20:58.500
I don't want to do something like that...

00:21:01.990 --> 00:21:05.190
Improving her relationship with Ohno comes first this time.

00:21:05.650 --> 00:21:07.750
Cosplaying is just a means to achieve that, right?

00:21:08.130 --> 00:21:10.490
Well, I guess so.

00:21:10.760 --> 00:21:14.720
Anyway, even though Ogiue kept saying no, she still tried it.

00:21:15.320 --> 00:21:17.190
Someday, she'll show herself to you guys, right?

00:21:18.160 --> 00:21:21.170
Hmm... Someday...?

00:21:21.360 --> 00:21:23.250
W-What are your thoughts about cosplaying?

00:21:23.250 --> 00:21:24.370
It sucks!

00:21:25.310 --> 00:21:27.690
I know very well that it's something that doesn't suit me.

00:21:29.050 --> 00:21:32.240
Perhaps this will change the mood a bit for the better...

00:23:20.830 --> 00:23:23.150
What's wrong, Ohno-san? You don't look well.

00:23:23.150 --> 00:23:26.240
Kujian has ended. I wonder what we should do from now on...

00:23:26.240 --> 00:23:29.800
Ah, that's right... There are no more Kujian meetings...

00:23:29.800 --> 00:23:31.140
It feels really lonely...

00:23:31.140 --> 00:23:33.970
I don't understand why you guys are so obsessed over it.

00:23:33.970 --> 00:23:35.450
Eh? Is that so...?

00:23:36.070 --> 00:23:37.920
Don't worry, you guys!

00:23:38.320 --> 00:23:39.300
Don't be sad.

00:23:39.300 --> 00:23:44.460
Ritsuko Kübel Kettenkrad, Enomoto Chihiro and Akiyama Tokino will always live on in your hearts!

00:23:44.460 --> 00:23:46.500
Their journey has just begun!

00:23:47.700 --> 00:23:49.370
Eh? I was off...?
